# Phase 332 (WAF-01) — sudoers grant for the app-layer WAF fail2ban abuse-jail wrapper.
# Security model: grant on ONE explicit binary path, NO glob, NO arg wildcard.
# The wrapper validates its action enum
# {ensure-log-dir|install-jail|remove-jail|status|reload}, owns every fail2ban filter/jail
# body (fixed heredocs), and the ONLY caller inputs are three integers (maxretry/findtime/
# bantime) re-validated ^[0-9]{1,7}$ root-side — so no caller string can reach a generated
# config or ban an arbitrary target (332-CONTEXT D-332-7).
# Deploy: deploy-livinityd.sh; day-2: update.sh Step 7.10w.
Cmnd_Alias LIVINITYD_WAF = /usr/local/lib/livos/livos-waf.sh
bruce ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: LIVINITYD_WAF
